    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Introduction</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>This is a puzzle-platformer based on real physics. Players must cleverly adjust platform angles to guide a gravity-affected ball through rolling and jumping until it safely reaches the bottom platform. Simple yet challenging!</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Freeze time while the ball is mid-air to carefully adjust platforms below</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clear levels to unlock 10 unique balls for collection</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ball types include common sports balls: basketball, soccer, bowling, tennis, golf...</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each ball has unique bounce, dynamic/static friction, weight and size, creating completely different strategic experiences!</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Introduction</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>This is a puzzle-platformer based on real physics. Players must cleverly adjust platform angles to guide a gravity-affected ball through rolling and jumping until it safely reaches the bottom platform. Simple yet challenging!</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Freeze time while the ball is mid-air to carefully adjust platforms below</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clear levels to unlock 10 unique balls for collection</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ball types include common sports balls: basketball, soccer, bowling, tennis, golf...</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each ball has unique bounce, dynamic/static friction, weight and size, creating completely different strategic experiences!</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "&quot;Physics Puzzle Ball&quot; is a realistic physics simulation game.",
